You are implementing DQ-RCV-URS-001 and DQ-RCV-DS-001 in this repository.

The two parent documents and everything under specs/ are inputs. They are not yours to edit unless a human opens a specification change.

## Loop

1. Read the requirement and its must-not list.
2. Change only factory code under src/dq_recovery/ or add a regression fixture under tests/.
3. Run the named acceptance command. It exits 0 or you are not done.
4. If a gate is wrong, stop. Do not weaken it.

## Must not

- Invent an acceptance criterion.
- Edit specs/ or the parent URS/design to match an implementation.
- Default an unclassified record kind into the expression grammar.
- Cluster on semantic hash.
- Report a record as matched when parse_status is not complete.
- Name a rule type.
- Choose between two readings. Emit both.
- Relax a gate so the build passes.

One prompt shape: Implement REQ-R0x against specs/. Stop when tests.test_<name> exits 0. Do not change acceptance.
Never: recover these mappings into rules.
